;; The version, in a file rather than in a BUILD attribute.
;;
;; clj_maven_export reads this in an ACTION, not during analysis, which is what lets a
;; release bump one file and re-run one action instead of re-analysing the graph. It is
;; also the shape a Clojure project already has: the same file a release workflow reads
;; to check the tag, and that a version-consistency test reads to check the README.
;;
;; A bare "0.1.0" works too; the map is what most projects have.
{:version "0.1.0"}
